NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#automatrixGov kind=field
  digest=b3:5bdc7f4ed2ffa355f5a2b9a1d4922152ac07f93a6e93c9be1ea02ddcea003282 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=175:186 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7440:8269
  sig=server.AutomatrixGovernor
  doc=Automatrix idle-wake handler seams (task 3.3). automatrixGov is the\nper-user opt-in + Chronos-alarm bookkeeping seam (satisfied by task 6.1);\nautomatrixRunner dispatches the supervised restricted-surface run for a\npicked opportunity (the task 4.1 hand-off). Both are nil until their wave\nwires them: a wake with no governor does nothing (fail closed — proactive\nwork never runs without an authoritative opt-in), and a pick with no\nrunner reschedules without running. automatrixRand is the injectable,\nseedable RNG behind the jitter + probabilistic-skip reschedule (guarded by\nautomatrixRandMu because rand.Rand is not safe for concurrent use);\nautomatrixSkipProb is the per-fire skip probability (config-like; tests\npin it to 0/1 for determinism).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#automatrixInflight kind=field
  digest=b3:f333c25d733d4714027f7febd526d56435abaf805ae4e1dd298d2e326b07c3c1 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=208:213 lang=go exported=false byte_range=9379:9783
  sig=atomic.Int32
  doc=automatrixInflight counts autonomous Automatrix runs currently executing\n(task 4.1). It is the busy signal that makes a fresh wake DEFER while a\nproactive run is already underway (req 4.5): Automatrix never runs two\nproactive tasks at once for a user, and never competes with the run it\nalready started. Bumped around the supervised dispatch goroutine.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#automatrixNotifier kind=field
  digest=b3:cc2bc22731025945e4382b93258a83ae64b81da671bb78e4dc7c7e66710b7087 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=220:228 lang=go exported=false byte_range=10108:10733
  sig=notify.Notifier
  doc=automatrixNotifier is the out-of-app completion ping (task 5.3). It is\nbuilt from config in NewEngine (ntfy default + optional Apprise fan-out;\na noop when neither is configured) and fired BEST-EFFORT + non-blocking on\na GENUINE, gate-passed autonomous completion — AFTER the durable in-app\nrecord is written, so a failed external send neither blocks the run nor\ndisturbs the canonical record (req 6.4, honest failure). Tests/wiring may\noverride it via SetAutomatrixNotifier with a real Notifier pointed at an\nhttptest server. Never nil for a built engine.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

