NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#briefRunner kind=field
  digest=b3:76fcd238173ccbb709ad1754b2727272964c9915c20ec119e6df53a63811cdb2 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=193:201 lang=go exported=false byte_range=8585:9218
  sig=server.BriefRunner
  doc=briefRunner dispatches the restricted, supervised morning-brief run for a\nfired MORNING_BRIEF wake (task 5.4). Nil until wired (serve.go sets it to\nRunMorningBrief; tests may install a seam via SetBriefRunner): a wake with\nno runner does nothing (fail closed). briefInflight is the busy signal\nthat keeps a fresh wake from double-dispatching a brief already underway;\nbriefWG tracks the dispatch goroutines so Close drains them (bounded) —\na run that outlives the bound stays durably running in the task ledger and\nresumes on the restricted brief surface at next boot.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

