NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#warmOnce kind=field
  digest=b3:8ab02e405ffc9e9acbf511c09d0550ee50df071a20ebfbbb4d2ffe38d7b8c733 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=230:237 lang=go exported=false byte_range=10736:11265
  sig=sync.Once
  doc=Q2 warm-on-open: the FIRST inbound HTTP request fires a one-shot,\nnon-blocking warm of the embedder + HNSW semantic substrate (the only real\ncold-start on the memory path — Activate/StorySoFar are cheap materialized\nreads), so the first message's relevance recall doesn't pay it. warmOnce\nmakes it idempotent; warmed flips true once the background warm completes\n(observable for tests + readiness). A nil pager, a missing embedder, or a\ncleared WarmOnOpen flag makes Warm a no-op.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine#warmStop kind=field
  digest=b3:396cbabea9c4e899e35aa79971c499b44a02aee0d3f3fd1081597b429323dd3b file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=239:243 lang=go exported=false byte_range=11289:11569
  sig=chan struct{}
  doc=warmStop + warmWG bound the warm goroutine's lifetime to the engine's:\nClose closes warmStop (cancelling an in-flight warm read) and waits on\nwarmWG, so a caller that closes the pager right after Close can never\nrace the warm's Retrieve.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine

