NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine.activeConvID kind=method
  digest=b3:960cbeb0a16fc2b2556ac5528ab22aae216692ae5e78d7dc05189eef8f17d9db file=neo/internal/server/dojo.go range=67:84 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2266:2769
  sig=func (e *Engine) activeConvID() string
  doc=activeConvID reports the conversation of a currently executing run — the\nbinding target for a desktop session the agent implicitly boots mid-run.\nEach daemon is single-tenant, so any live run is the user's own; with more\nthan one live the most recently registered wins.
