  doc=emitConstructSurface is the ACTIVE-tier Construct emitter wired into the tool\nmanager: it streams an agent-authored surface onto the active run's event\nstream as a construct.surface event. Pure side-channel — it only publishes a\ntranscript event, exactly like surfaceTool / notifyFor; it never signs,\nwrites Neocortex, or touches the plan/walk.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/engine.go

