  doc=handleMorningBriefWake runs the fail-closed wake gate and, on an eligible\nwake, dispatches the supervised restricted-surface brief run. Best-effort\nthroughout — a governor/runner error is logged and never wedges the wake.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/brief_wake.go

