  sig=func briefPolicyViolation(text string, recentRecs, recentURLs []string) string
  doc=briefPolicyViolation runs the deterministic post-check over a composed brief\nagainst the recently-delivered recommendations + source URLs. Returns ""\nwhen the brief passes, else a one-line reason (logged; the brief is not\ndelivered).
