NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.copyProjectTree kind=func
  digest=b3:6f3b7f0f1a9fd51d35c6a07e7373009605d9bd541fc6922615923e212d39e2ba file=neo/internal/server/projects.go range=381:433 lang=go exported=false byte_range=10710:12172
  sig=func copyProjectTree(source, destination string) (err error)
  doc=copyProjectTree creates a credential-clean, independent project copy. It\ndeliberately omits source-control metadata, dependency/build caches,\nAgentCore state, and dotenv files. Symlinks and special files are refused so\na fork cannot retain an out-of-project capability through an external link.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/projects.go

