  sig=func jitteredInterval(base, jitter time.Duration, rng *rand.Rand) time.Duration
  doc=jitteredInterval computes the next-fire delay as base ± a uniform draw in\n[-jitter, +jitter], floored at automatrixMinInterval so a wide jitter (or a\nzero base) can never schedule an immediate/past wake. Consumes one rng draw\nonly when jitter > 0.
