NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.session#automatrix kind=field
  digest=b3:55cc463eddb4b1f23bc995964a6dc50b847d3245e25383f47461793dc8348134 file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=43:51 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1090:1674
  sig=bool
  doc=automatrix marks this as an ephemeral session driving an autonomous\nAutomatrix opportunity (task 4.1). It changes exactly two things: the\nagent is built on the RESTRICTED (no-money) tool surface via\nagent.NewAutomatrix (so a proactive run physically cannot reach the\nsigning path, req 3.2), and the run is driven by the quiet\nsuperviseAutomatrixTask loop (no SSE/broker surfacing — req 5.5 surfaces\nNOTHING; the surprise result is delivered out of band by task 5.3). A\nnormal session leaves this false and is byte-identical to before.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.session

NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.session#automatrixOut kind=field
  digest=b3:d45dff3dce2d6f9f36af0fed10baadc5eb21946aeb1a138983d4193774e5dd4b file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=53:59 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1677:2116
  sig=*server.automatrixReporter
  doc=automatrixOut is the quiet capture reporter for an Automatrix run (set\nonly when automatrix is true). It surfaces NOTHING to the user (req 5.5)\nbut retains the agent's final user-facing answer so the completion path\n(task 5.3) can use it as the result-not-protocol summary of what Neo\nproduced. Reused across supervisor respawns so the last attempt's answer\nis the captured result.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.session

